    "detailed_description": "Welcome to \u300aIDLE HEROS\u300b<br>Our world is being destroyed by the gods, and heroes are organizing to fight against it.<br>Although it is a 2D game, but has super cool combat, strategic<br>If you like the placement genre, give this game a try<br><strong>Unique hero</strong><br>IDLE HEROS currently has 27 heroes, and new heroes will be added in the future.<br>Each hero has his own characteristic skill, 3 optional skills, and a powerful talent tree.<br><strong>Rich equipment attributes</strong><br>\u300aIDLE HEROS\u300bThere are many equipment attributes, equipment can be synthesized, different attributes can be matched with different heroes, there are many rare attributes, waiting for you to experience ~<br><strong>Explore the unknown</strong><br>\u300aIDLE HEROS\u300bExploration gameplay is full of unknowns, rich rewards in exploration, can be synthesized, and rewards can be even richer after synthesis<br><strong>Risk group</strong><br>\u300aIDLE HEROS\u300bcan form a 5 member adventure party, get bonus stats and goodies, and invite your friends to join~",
